{"articleNo":"2079","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=2079&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2012학년도 수시모집 면접고사실 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.10.21","hit":"13427","attachments":[{"name":"면접대기실 알림표-일반전형(전체).xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=2079&attachNo=69784"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><font face=\"굴림\"><font size=\"5\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</font><font size=\"4\">&nbsp;&nbsp; -&nbsp; <span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2012학년도 수시모집 면접고사실 안내 -</span></font></font>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle1\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;2012학년도 수시모집 교과성적우수자 전형 면접고사실을 다음과 같이 안내<br>하오니 면접대상 수험생은 면접․구술고사에 참석하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><a href=\"http://kumohweb.kumoh.ac.kr/mybsvr/etx/susi/susi1_hap_step1.htm\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></a><a href=\"http://kumohweb.kumoh.ac.kr/mybsvr/etx/susi/susi1_hap_step1.htm\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #800080; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">▶ 면접번호 및 면접대기실 확인 바로가기</span></a></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">1. 전형유형 : 교과성적우수자 전형</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2. 면접․구술고사 일정</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span> </p>\n<table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"42\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"138\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">면접․구술고사일</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"42\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"104\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">오전․오후</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"42\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"104\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">입실완료시간</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"42\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"104\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">면접고사</span></p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">시작시간</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"52\" valign=\"middle\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"138\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">10.29(토)</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"26\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"104\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">오전반</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"26\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"104\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">08:30</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"26\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"104\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">09:00</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"26\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"104\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">오후반</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"26\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"104\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">13:00</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"26\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"104\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">13:30</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font size=\"3\">3. 준비물 : 면접수험표, 신분증(주민등록증, 학생증, 운전면허증, 여권<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;등), 필기구</font></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font size=\"3\">4. 면접․구술고사에 결시하는 경우 불합격 처리합니다.</font></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">5. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">면접․구술고사 대기실 등에서는 통신기기(휴대폰, 무전기, PDA 등)와 녹취기<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; (보이스 펜 포함)를&nbsp;</span></font><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;휴대할 수 없으며, 면접․구술고사 종료 후라도 면접ㆍ구술<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; 고사 중 통신기기 등의 사용이 확인될&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 경우 불합격 처리합니다.</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font size=\"3\">6. 면접․구술고사 시작후 입실 불가(오전반 09:00, 오후반 13:30)</font></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font size=\"3\">7. 수험생은 면접·구술고사 관련 면접·구술위원 및 진행요원의 지시에<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;따라야 함.</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font size=\"3\">8. 기타 문의사항은 우리 대학교 입학관리본부(054-478-7900)로 문의. </font></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font size=\"3\">9. 당일 교통 혼잡이 예상되므로 가급적 대중교통수단을 이용하여 주시기<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;바랍니다. </font></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
